      "body": "Below, we will keep track of all the changes made over the lifetime of this document. This way, all our members can see how the documents are changing over time.\n\nJanuary - 2026 (V. 26.1) Formatting redone for consistency and readability. Except points listed below, no content changes.\n\nAdd: “1. Implementation” (and subsequent modification of all Title numbers in the document) Clarification:\n\n- Split of “1. Definition and general requirements” in “2. Definition” and “3. General Requirements”.\nThis split doesn’t have an impact on the content of the rules.\n\nMarch-2025 (V2025.03)\n\n- Formatting: Overall grammar and formatting\n\n- add: 8.1: the 4th plate can be removed\n\n- add: 4.5: Side panels lack shaping, Does not adequately protect the malleolus bone, rule 1.2.\n- add: 3.5: Greaves with riveted ankle part (not based on historical sources)\n\nDecember-2024: -add Document has been created",
